title: Bernie Sanders
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, reformist
card-image: img/portraits/AufhäuserSiegfried.jpg
view-if: sanders_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Bernie Sanders

Sanders is the standard-bearer of the Socialist wing. Though he is technically an Independent, he holds significant sway over the party.

- @grassroots
- @reconciliation
- @mobilize
- @organize
- @unity
- @root: Return to main

@grassroots
title: Grassroots Fundraising
subtitle: Raise limited funds directly through voters
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += (dues-1); populism += 2

Sanders has used his grassroots campaigning skills to raise funds for the party.

@reconciliation
title: Budget Reconciliation
subtitle: Utilize Sanders' position as Budget Committee Chair
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if senate_majority = 0 : Sanders is not Chair of the Budget Committee! ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

With Sanders as Chair of the Budget Committee, we are able to use the Budget Reconciliation process to pass funding legislation.

@mobilize
title: Mobilize the Socialist wing
subtitle: Using his sway over the party, Sanders can invigorate the Socialists.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and dsa_split = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if dsa_split != 0 : With DSA Independent, our Socialist wing is practically nonexistent. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; socialist_strength += 10; populism += 7; conservative_dissent += 10; mainstream_dissent += 5

We have mobilized the Democratic Socialists within the party.

@organize
title: Organize blue-collar voters
subtitle: Sanders has proven to be extremely effective at mobilizing working-class voters to vote blue.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; populism += 3; socialist_strength += 3; progressive_strength += 2

Sanders has used his grassroots campaigning skills to increase Democratic turnout among blue-collar workers.

@unity
title: Socialist-Progressive Unity
subtitle: Sanders represents a bridge between the Socialists and Progressives; that can be utilized.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 0; socialist_strength += 2; progressive_strength += 2; populism += 2; socialist_dissent -= 10; progressive_dissent -= 10

Sanders has used his wide-reaching connections to foster goodwill between the Socialists and Progressives.
